{"reviews":[{"id":"B089RH1RLM-0","r":5.0,"t":"My thoughts on 15,000 nail art slices","x":"Ok so I\u2019m really happy with this product! The packaging was great and had no problems with it at all the fruits were individually packaged and was easy to organize the best thing is I thought that the fruit were like fragile so if I moved them I was scared they would break but they don\u2019t they are actually easy to work with and I can bend them with no problem so 10/10","h":30,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-1","r":5.0,"t":"Wow I'm Impressed!!","x":"I love this product it was packaged so neatly and beautiful vibrant colors fast shipping thank you so much will definite buy again from this seller.","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-2","r":5.0,"t":"BEST SELECTION EVER JUST BUY IT","x":"Has rare fruit that other packs don\u2019t have, all the pieces are the super cute ones I\u2019m so glad I picked this set","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-3","r":1.0,"t":"Bad Quality","x":"I honestly didn\u2019t think these were going to be such bad quality. I got a big pack and all the images were low quality and not cute designs. I\u2019d give them no stars honestly. I have a tons of clients who were waiting on these products and they don\u2019t want them anymore now that they\u2019ve seen the quality of the pieces.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-4","r":5.0,"t":"Love these","x":"Love these they are so cute and they came beautifully packaged. So thankful that they are already separated making me able to use them right away. I will definitely be ordering again! They did also come in another bag with these lil bags","h":6,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-5","r":4.0,"t":"Ok","x":"There not bad at all going to use them in lipgloss. The only thing is some cuts r small and some r big the closeup pice u can see it with the strawberry one small one big. Other than that it\u2019s ok","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-6","r":3.0,"t":"Cute","x":"These are cute but I have to return them because they look way to thick for what i wanted to use them for. They are a rubber type of material like an eraser and I thought they were like a thick paper. I have not opened them but they look like they are good quality and the colors are pretty.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-7","r":5.0,"t":"Definitely recommend.","x":"I love these, I use them in lip gloss. The price is what got my attention. I received the fruit ones and I got every fruit I wanted. The fruits comes in individual bags, which means I didn\u2019t have to sort them out. They all came intact too, not cut up pieces. I purchased some before from another company and they came altogether, causing me to sort them out for 30 minutes and the pieces were partially cut. I definitely recommend this product to whoever\u2019s looking.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-8","r":5.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"A few are broken but they have a lot in each bag so no big deal.. let me just say I absolutely love them bought for the strawberry slices for some strawberry nails I wanted to do but I love all of them they also seem to be softer than expected which is great for nails you can bend a bit if need be. I absolutely love them!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-9","r":5.0,"t":"Very vibrant","x":"Very vibrant and neat! I love all of them and. will order more in the future. They are all packaged and organized into each individual fruit or group.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-10","r":3.0,"t":"Ok","x":"Each fruit was halfway filled in the bag. Not enough of each piece","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-11","r":5.0,"t":"SO CUTEEE","x":"loved that each of the tiny ziplock bags were full. Didn\u2019t think it would bring so many. Excited to try. Nice size and super cute. Not sure why some people are saying they are bad quality, you can tell exactly what fruit is which and each are really detailed .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-12","r":5.0,"t":"SO CUTE","x":"I love using these, I do resin crafts and put them on my nails, which is awesome because some are thinner than others, and those are perfect for getting it on the curve of my nail. Plan on using these in my homemade lip gloss too","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-13","r":5.0,"t":"So impressed!","x":"I am so impressed by the quality of these little shapes.  I was not sure what to expect but these are amazing and there is a great variety of each type.  I will definitely purchase these again!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-14","r":5.0,"t":"If you're doing nails these are perfect","x":"Perfect for nails, thin and just the right size. Tons of cute designs. Each theme packaged separately and plenty of each design. A few broken ones but out of the thousands it's no big deal.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-15","r":5.0,"t":"SO CUTE","x":"Awesome product! they're all so cute. the only things I would say is they could be sold in better packaging, and they smell a bit like chemicals.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-16","r":3.0,"t":"Muy poco","x":"Crei que eran m\u00e1s cantidad. No me gusto \ud83d\ude14","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-17","r":5.0,"t":"It's a lot for a great price","x":"Love the fact that it is separated according to designs. Thought it would have been a good idea to add to lip gloss container, did not work as I expected. Lots of products for a good price!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-18","r":5.0,"t":"So cute!","x":"These are so cute! I use them in my lip gloss. I would advise to wash them before you do so if you are also using them in gloss, BUT they are so cute. I definitely recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-19","r":3.0,"t":"Good product but got two of the same fruit.","x":"I loved the little fruits, but bummed out when I saw that I got a duplicate. Also seems like they shortened me on baggies, some people get up to 18 little bags and I got 14.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-20","r":5.0,"t":"Cute!","x":"[[VIDEOID:4e9acde8ea1272ea416455cd6c492b32]] Love the variety!  The slices are perfect for nails, not too thick.  Expected less for the price but it's really cute.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-21","r":5.0,"t":"SO GOOD FOR THE PRICE","x":"I bought these cause I wanted to start doing acrylics, no regrets! There are so many bags of cute fruits and a lot in each bag. 100% you should buy!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-22","r":5.0,"t":"Good for the price","x":"Good enough for the price, some of them are cut very thin and can't be use. So you have to pay attention if you are using for your bussiness","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-23","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty acrylic nails with fruit","x":"I\u2019m using these to encapsulate in my acrylic nails, and they\u2019re absolutely so adorable! Shipping was fast and item is as described. (:","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B089RH1RLM-24","r":4.0,"t":"Super cute","x":"Super cute! I think I seen some other people\u2019s pictures and the looked FULL but these weren\u2019t so full :/ still very cute though!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Customers frequently praise the cute designs and vibrant colors, with many saying the pieces are detailed and well-organized by type.","cites":[2,3,5,10,12,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers highlight the neat, individually separated packaging that makes the pieces easy to use right away.","cites":[1,2,5,8,10,12,15]},{"text":"Several customers note the pieces are thinner or softer than expected, which some find perfect for nails while others find too thick for their needs.","cites":[7,9,13,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers report quality or quantity issues, such as low-quality images, inconsistent sizes, or bags not being fully filled.","cites":[4,6,11]},{"text":"Some customers mention a few broken pieces, though most consider it a minor issue given the large quantity.","cites":[9,15]}]},"qa":[]}